# GS18: from the goma_pillar save (Goma Cave's pillar room, east pillar settled; continue with vale_day1_continue.keys +
# --flash-in). Routes found with tests/probes/hpath.cjs (height- and layer-aware search) and walked with autowalk (its A
# taps fight the random battles). South along the lower floor, the jump cell at 22,22 over the wall row to 22,24, east
# to the stairs (33,24, exit 7) down to the pond room (f3593, a Zombie battle on the way); north-west round the pond to
# its west stairs (7,4) up to the pillar room's west ledge (f6713, 14,11); north to 18,6 (a battle), **Move** east on the
# west pillar (it slides to column 21, the cells along its track change); the jump cells 18,6 -> 20,6 -> 20,8, south to
# 21,12 (y 32), **Move** east on the stump: it tips over the edge at column 25 and falls into the pond room; back west and
# down the west stairs (f11255), the stump's jump cells across the pond (13,6 -> 13,8 -> 15,8), the pond's east stairs up
# (f11710) to the pillar room's east ledge (32,14), the jump cells over the sunk pillar (36 -> 38 -> 40) to Forge (a battle
# on the way); Cure on Isaac, Garet and Ivan; talk to **Forge** (f13940): the Djinni battle (battlebot BB_SEQ: Isaac Quake,
# Garet attacks, Ivan Ray; Flint unleashed in round 3), Forge felled, joins (red tint), the man in orange is impressed and
# leaves.
